  <title>Final Exam Time</title>

  <p>
    The final exam time for this class is scheduled for <alert>Wednesday, December 16 at 10:30 am</alert>. 
  </p>
  <p>
    We will be having the final Group Oral Assessment of Learning (GOAL) during the final exam time. You are required to be there to 
    work with your group. If you are unable to attend due to a school sanctioned activity or illness, you will need to schedule an 
    individual quiz before the end of finals week. 
  </p>

